### Health check
GET http://localhost:7070/api/health


### Ask coach
POST http://localhost:7070/api/coach
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "How long should I rest between heavy sets?"
}


### Ask coach with empty prompt
POST http://localhost:7070/api/coach
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": ""
}


### Create exercise
POST http://localhost:7070/api/exercises
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bench Press",
  "muscleGroup": "CHEST",
  "sets": 4,
  "reps": 8
}


### Get all exercises
GET http://localhost:7070/api/exercises


### Get exercise by id
GET http://localhost:7070/api/exercises/3


### Update exercise
PUT http://localhost:7070/api/exercises/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Barbell Bench Press",
  "muscleGroup": "CHEST",
  "sets": 5,
  "reps": 5
}


### Delete exercise
DELETE http://localhost:7070/api/exercises/3


### Get exercise that does not exist
GET http://localhost:7070/api/exercises/999999


### Get exercise with invalid id
GET http://localhost:7070/api/exercises/0


### Create user
POST http://localhost:7070/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "age": 24,
  "height": 180,
  "weight": 80,
  "experienceLevel": "BEGINNER",
  "trainingDaysPerWeek": 4,
  "goal": "MUSCLE_GAIN"
}


### Get all users
GET http://localhost:7070/api/users


### Get user by id
GET http://localhost:7070/api/users/3


### Get user that does not exist
GET http://localhost:7070/api/users/999999


### Generate workout program for user
POST http://localhost:7070/api/users/3/workout-program


### Check user after workout program generation
GET http://localhost:7070/api/users/3